    "description": "Are you a skilled Senior Software Engineer looking for your next big career move? Dell India Consulting Pvt Ltd in Nagpur offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Dell India Consulting Pvt Ltd:\nDell India Consulting Pvt Ltd is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve software defects and performance issues\n• Integrate third-party APIs and services\n• Implement new features based on product requirements\n• Contribute to system architecture and technical design decisions\n• Participate in code reviews and contribute to technical discussions\n• Work with agile methodologies including daily stand-ups and sprint planning\n• Deploy and manage applications on cloud platforms like AWS, Azure, or GCP\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Python\n• Proficiency in SQL\n• Proficiency in Go\n• Proficiency in TensorFlow\n• Proficiency in REST APIs\n• Proficiency in Agile/Scrum\n• Proficiency in Docker\n• Proficiency in AWS\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Learning & development budget\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Nagpur, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dell India Consulting Pvt Ltd!",
